options to requests:

<img src="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/stainless-api/sdk-assets/refs/heads/main/node.svg" align="top" width="18" height="21"> **Node** <sup>[[docs](https:/
/github.com/nodejs/undici/blob/main/docs/docs/api/ProxyAgent.md#example---proxyagent-with-fetch)]</sup>

```ts
import AlchemystAI from '@alchemystai/sdk';
import * as undici from 'undici';

const proxyAgent = new undici.ProxyAgent('http://localhost:8888');
const client = new AlchemystAI({
  fetchOptions: {
    dispatcher: proxyAgent,
  },
});
```

